<title>CANADA: Canada dlr strengthens on positive fundamentals.</title>
<headline>Canada dlr strengthens on positive fundamentals.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3640/1.3720	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3700</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3640   SUPPORT 1.3800	HI 1.3710   LO  1.3674</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3693/98    HI 1.3697     EUROPE OPEN     1.3700</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3705/10    LO 1.3669     HI 1.3708   LO  1.3670</p>
<p>-----------------------MARKET COMMENT-------------------------</p>
<p>* Canada's dollar strengthened on positive fundamentals and moderate volume to C$1.3681 (US$0.7310) from this morning's open of C$1.3693 ($US0.7303), bouncing off a 200-day moving average, dealers said.</p>
<p>* Goldman, Sachs predicts a stronger Canadian dollar will hit C$1.33 by year end.</p>
